{"story_id":39597,"updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:20:48","headline_en":"Tibet residents face housing crisis after magnitude 7 earthquake leaves 32 injured","headline_hi":"मैग्नीट्यूड 7 के भूकंप के बाद 32 लोगों के घायल होने से तिब्बत के निवासियों को आवास संकट का सामना करना पड़ रहा है","payload_en":{"story_id":39597,"headline":"Tibet residents face housing crisis after magnitude 7 earthquake leaves 32 injured","counts":{"articles":13,"independent_sources":10,"outlets":12},"has_established":true,"qualified_by":"interim","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Anadolu Agency","DW","Daily Mirror Sri Lanka","France 24","Hindustan Times","India Today","Khaleej Times","NDTV","News18","The Express Tribune","The Hindu","WION"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":39597,"parents":[],"children":[],"written_at":"2026-10-23T02:20:48","category":{"primary":["world","life"],"secondary":["abroad","accidents"]},"places":[],"people":["Nagqu","Tibet","Lhasa","USGS","local government officials","China Earthquake Networks Center","Eurasian","Tibetan Plateau"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"A 7.0-magnitude earthquake struck China's Tibet region on Thursday 22 October 2026, and a magnitude 7 earthquake struck Nagqu in northern Tibet.","ids":[64929,64955],"parts":[{"text":"A 7.0-magnitude earthquake struck China's Tibet region on Thursday 22 October 2026,","ids":[64929],"class":"established"},{"text":"and a magnitude 7 earthquake struck Nagqu in northern Tibet.","ids":[64955],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8]},{"text":"There were no immediate reports of casualties or damage following it.","ids":[64943],"class":"unverified","sources":[1,3,5,7,8]}],[{"text":"The Tibetan Plateau is prone to powerful earthquakes due to the collision of the Eurasian and Indian tectonic plates.","ids":[64948],"class":"single","sources":[7]}],[{"text":"The average elevation within 5 km of the epicentre is about 4,864 metres, and the epicentre was in a high-altitude county in Nagqu, northern Tibet, at a depth of 10 km, China Earthquake Networks Center said.","ids":[64938,64937],"class":"unverified","sources":[3,7,8]}],[{"text":"The earthquake was clearly felt in the local area, and the tremor is the strongest earthquake to hit China since January 2024.","ids":[64945,64957],"class":"unverified","sources":[3,7,8]}],[{"text":"At least 339 residential buildings collapsed, local government officials said.","ids":[64917],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Twenty livestock sheds were destroyed, local government officials said.","ids":[64919],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"11 of the injured people are in a serious condition, local media office said.","ids":[64921],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"The earthquake epicenter is 190 kilometers northeast of Nagqu, the earthquake's epicentre was located in a mountainous area about 190 kilometres east-northeast of Nagqu, and the earthquake's epicentre was located in a mountainous area about 390 kilometres northeast of Lhasa, US Geological Survey said.","ids":[64923,64964,64965],"class":"single","sources":[2,4,6]}],[{"text":"The USGS issued a yellow alert for shaking-related fatalities and an orange alert for economic losses.","ids":[64950,64951],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Estimated economic losses are less than 1% of China's GDP, USGS said.","ids":[64952],"class":"single","sources":[1]}],[{"text":"The earthquake struck at a shallow depth of 10 kilometres.","ids":[64933],"class":"established","sources":[1,2,4,5,6,8]}],[{"text":"The epicentre was around 400 km away from the Tibetan capital of Lhasa, and it was at 32.40 degrees north latitude and 93.79 degrees east longitude.","ids":[64946,64947],"parts":[{"text":"The epicentre was around 400 km away from the Tibetan capital of Lhasa,","ids":[64946],"class":"established"},{"text":"and it was at 32.40 degrees north latitude and 93.79 degrees east longitude.","ids":[64947],"class":"single"}],"class":"single","sources":[3,5,7]}],[{"text":"Shallow earthquakes up to 70 kilometers deep are considered more dangerous and destructive.","ids":[64926],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","say","say","say","say","say","say","numbers","numbers","explained"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aa.com.tr/en/asia-pacific/strong-tremor-of-magnitude-7-strikes-china-s-tibet-disaster-potentially-widespread-usgs/4097591","outlet":"Anadolu Agency","title":"Strong tremor of magnitude 7 strikes China’s Tibet, disaster potentially widespread: USGS","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://www.dw.com/en/tibet-earthquake-kills-at-least-16-people-injures-dozens-state-media/a-79738117?maca=en-rss-en-all-1573-rdf","outlet":"DW","title":"Tibet earthquake kills at least 16 people, injures dozens: state media","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Earthquake-of-magnitude-7-strikes-China’s-Tibet/108-353194","outlet":"Daily Mirror Sri Lanka","title":"Earthquake of magnitude 7 strikes China’s Tibet","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20261022-many-dead-massive-earthquake-strikes-china-s-remote-tibet-region-magnitude-seven","outlet":"France 24","title":"Strong earthquake strikes China’s remote Tibet region","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.indiatoday.in/world/story/7-magnitude-earthquake-strikes-tibet-months-after-deadly-flash-floods-in-the-region-3023004-2026-10-22","outlet":"India Today","title":"7-magnitude earthquake strikes Tibet months after deadly flash floods in the region","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://www.news18.com/world/tibet-earthquake-16-dead-32-injured-as-7-0-magnitude-quake-strikes-remote-region-ws-l-10393614.html","outlet":"News18","title":"Tibet Earthquake: 16 Dead, 32 Injured As 7.0-Magnitude Quake Strikes Remote Region","p